{"steam_appid":4038320,"steam_name":"This Ain’t Even Poker, Ya Joker","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038320/1675374147/1ac8e9a97e4eaedbca9915dc84a06f9ac6d3e4d5/1765441900/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765442488","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247183/d26b28e4f47d99ab55b9402cd646a2a2f8b726b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765442488","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/c95ac6b8df187a6ee8f9ec9d2fd7437d306f0b48/ss_c95ac6b8df187a6ee8f9ec9d2fd7437d306f0b48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768502326","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/d41dbbf848458df162a118224181971d9c861f2f/ss_d41dbbf848458df162a118224181971d9c861f2f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768502326","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/2f88cc0e63009125f3b493a6ac06ad5e04b924ad/ss_2f88cc0e63009125f3b493a6ac06ad5e04b924ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768502326","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/f8f84ed45184e68d952da558ede491eaa6336bad/ss_f8f84ed45184e68d952da558ede491eaa6336bad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768502326","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/140a06e2a5dcfeec966e3a27912036e95cf510bd/ss_140a06e2a5dcfeec966e3a27912036e95cf510bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768502326"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/7f9973afe7bfd327f6e838763f8eca84.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/7f9973afe7bfd327f6e838763f8eca84.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/7f9973afe7bfd327f6e838763f8eca84.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new cards to increase your odds of hitting good hands. If you're rich enough, you can even break the rules and get over 5 cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO ON EXPEDITIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/f23902fdecd2f4708df1cf924313a798.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/f23902fdecd2f4708df1cf924313a798.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/f23902fdecd2f4708df1cf924313a798.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once unlocked, you can send your minions on expeditions to discover new otherworldy cards with powerful benefits. Upgrade these missions to provide even more powerful benefits as you progress. You can even unlock missions to destroy cards from your deck that you don't want, to ensure every hand is exactly how you want it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET UPGRADED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/3df4c9219f71d8d042fa47084b548add.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/3df4c9219f71d8d042fa47084b548add.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/3df4c9219f71d8d042fa47084b548add.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy powerful upgrades using your hard earned coins, enabling you to progress quicker, open up new avenues, and take on the evil Jester!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESTABLISH DOMINANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/9b9819d51763cfdeda60a2eb0d0cf259.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/9b9819d51763cfdeda60a2eb0d0cf259.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/9b9819d51763cfdeda60a2eb0d0cf259.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the Jester doesn't like it, you can buy new decks of cards in order to play more hands at once. Use this to your advantage to grow those numbers even faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASCEND TO GREATNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/859780c99c7efa3ec2f38dabff66c136.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/859780c99c7efa3ec2f38dabff66c136.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/859780c99c7efa3ec2f38dabff66c136.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a deal with Mary the Fairy to start over in exchange for Poker Chips (poker chips? ...but this ain't even poker...?), use those chips to buy even more powerful upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE HOUSE OF CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/d46cc4c267916249f13e345f7bf0f748.poster.avif?t=1768502326\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/d46cc4c267916249f13e345f7bf0f748.webm?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038320/extras/d46cc4c267916249f13e345f7bf0f748.mp4?t=1768502326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in the Jester's domain, can you manage to defeat him and escape? Or will he keep you there, trapped forever in an endless cycle?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 / AMD Phenom II<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Onboard<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Mash"],"publishers":["Oro Interactive","Drillhounds"],"release_date":"11 Dec, 2025"}